   "text": "# sackview\n\nSee what\u2019s inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it.\n\nList entry names, compressed sizes, and unpacked sizes. Check the total unpacked size against available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\n## Install\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\n## Inspect a ZIP archive\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\nLists the archive\u2019s entries with each entry\u2019s name, compressed size, and unpacked size.\n\n## Find the largest entries\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\nShows the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first.\n\n## Filter by name\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\nShows only entries whose names match the pattern.\n\n## Inspect offline\n\nsackview works offline and sends no archive contents to a service. It never extracts entries or changes the archive.\n\n## Supported format\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message.",
